\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Let all the world in every corner sing :
\par My God and King !
\par The Heavens are not too high, 
\par His praise may thither fly;
\par The earth is not too low,
\par His praises there may grow,
\par Let all the world in every corner sing:
\par My God and my king !
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Let all the world in every corner sing :
\par My God and my king !
\par The Church with psalms must shout,
\par No door can keep them out :
\par But, above all, the heart 
\par Must bear the longest part,
\par Let all the world in every corner sing :
\par My God and my king !
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

